Output out.mp4
Set Width 3840
Set Height 2160
Set FontSize 32
Set Theme { "background": "#333538", "foreground": "#FFFFFF", "cursor": "#FFFFFF", "selection": "#4A4D50", "black": "#333538", "white": "#FFFFFF" }
Set TypingSpeed 80ms
Set Margin 120
Set Padding 60

Sleep 1s
Type "apify actors search \"instagram\""
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s